                    <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#0C4A6E] border-2 border-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_14px_rgba(6,182,212,0.6)]"></span>
                    <span class="font-cursive text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap">Azul da Prússia</span>
